  {
    "hotel_id": "446567",
    "hotel_url": "https://www.agoda.com/js-luwansa-hotel-convention-center/hotel/jakarta-id.html",
    "name": "JS Luwansa Hotel & Convention Center",
    "detail": "JS Luwansa Hotel & Convention Center is a new and outstanding hotel in Jakarta. I stayed 2 nights there for business trip in middle of September in Jakarta. JS Luwansa's staff were very helpful and full of smiles as when I checked in at midnight but they have already prepared for my room so not taking time so much in reception area. Rooms are very clean,comfy,complete, and big. There are some facilities like free internet,hot shower,TV,telephone,as well as a sofa that is located near the window.The view of room is very nice because you can see highest office building and streets in Jakarta. Swimming pool is placed in 5th floor and you can swim and see the view directly. The buffet breakfast is assorted and mixed Asian and Western Food and you can request your fresh juices what you want and also the food is not the same as the day before. Overall, JS Luwansa can guarantee you to stay with a comfortable, pleasurable, and reliable. I would like to comeback to this hotel next time.",
